WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:06.000
Do you think people will return to Kfar Aza?

00:07.000 --> 00:08.633
It will take time.

00:08.633 --> 00:10.800
I don't know how many will be back.

00:11.366 --> 00:13.133
Not all of them will be back.

00:14.966 --> 00:18.500
I think that my daughter will not be back,

00:18.500 --> 00:20.666
and I have nothing to tell her,

00:20.666 --> 00:24.000
and I will not try to to convince her.

00:25.766 --> 00:28.000
because it's not...

00:31.133 --> 00:32.033
I can not.

00:32.333 --> 00:34.166
I can not tell her:

00:34.166 --> 00:38.666
"I want you to live with me here in Kfar Aza".

00:39.800 --> 00:41.900
Because she's afraid.

00:42.833 --> 00:45.633
She hasn't been here since the October 7th.

00:46.400 --> 00:48.900
Since the day when when we were together,

00:48.900 --> 00:50.133
when went out,

00:50.900 --> 00:53.466
she wasn't in her own house.

00:53.500 --> 00:56.233
a child, the little one, Rif,

00:58.100 --> 00:59.500
he doesn't know his house,

01:00.166 --> 01:01.800
he has never been there.

01:03.033 --> 01:06.333
So, most of the people, I believe, will come back.

01:06.333 --> 01:09.433
It will take time, but most of them will be back.

01:10.400 --> 01:15.033
But a big part of us will not be back.
